{"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"How to install and initialize EUDI Wallet Kit in your project","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Package-installation","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Package installation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To use EUDI Wallet Kit, add the following dependency to your Package.swift:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["dependencies: [","\t\t.package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/eu-digital-identity-wallet\/eudi-lib-ios-wallet-kit.git\", .upToNextMajor(from: \"0.6.6\"))","]"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then add the Eudi Wallet package to your target’s dependencies:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["dependencies: [","\t\t.product(name: \"EudiWalletKit\", package: \"eudi-lib-ios-wallet-kit\"),","]"]},{"anchor":"Initialization","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Initialization"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/EudiWallet","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" class provides a unified API for the two user attestation presentation flows. It is initialized with a document storage manager instance. For SwiftUI apps, the wallet instance can be added as an ","type":"text"},{"code":"environmentObject","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to be accessible from all views. A KeyChain implementation of document storage is available.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let config = EudiWalletConfiguration(serviceName: \"my_wallet_app\", logFileName: \"temp.txt\")","let trustConfig = TrustConfiguration(trustSource: .etsi(.eudiRef), fallbackTrustSource: nil)","let wallet = try! EudiWallet(eudiWalletConfig: config, trustConfig: trustConfig)","wallet.openID4VpConfig = OpenId4VpConfiguration(clientIdSchemes: [.x509SanDns, .x509Hash])","wallet.transactionLogger = MyFileTransactionLogger(wallet: wallet)","wallet.loadAllDocuments()"]},{"anchor":"Transaction-logging","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Transaction logging"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Implement ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TransactionLogger.log(transaction:)"},{"text":" with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TransactionEntry"},{"text":". Persist entries by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transactionIdentifier"},{"text":": subsequent calls update the same transaction. A request is saved with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transactionResult == .notCompleted"},{"text":" before credential selection, and updated after successful","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"response delivery. Cancellation, failures, and interrupted sessions remain ","type":"text"},{"code":"NotCompleted","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"reasonOfNoncompletion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" records a known reason.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Presentation "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"listOfClaimsRequested"},{"type":"text","text":" includes the union of every DCQL credential\/claim alternative,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"including unavailable credential types and all "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vct_values"},{"type":"text","text":". When claims are omitted, known paths"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from all matching wallet credentials are included. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"listOfClaimsPresented"},{"type":"text","text":" contains the disclosed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"claim paths. Entries do not store claim values."}]},{"anchor":"BLE-Transfer-Mode","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"BLE Transfer Mode"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/EudiWallet\/bleTransferMode","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" property controls the Bluetooth Low Energy role used during proximity (ISO 18013-5) presentation."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can set it during initialization via "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/EudiWalletConfiguration\/bleTransferMode","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or update it later on the wallet instance:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".server"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (default): The holder device acts as a GATT peripheral (server), advertising and waiting for the reader to connect."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".client","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The holder device acts as a GATT central (client), scanning and connecting to the reader’s peripheral."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".both"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The holder device supports both modes simultaneously and advertises both in the QR device engagement."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let config = EudiWalletConfiguration(","    serviceName: \"my_wallet_app\",","    bleTransferMode: .server  \/\/ default; use .client or .both as needed",")","let trustConfig = TrustConfiguration(trustSource: .etsi(.eudiRef), fallbackTrustSource: nil)","let wallet = try! EudiWallet(eudiWalletConfig: config, trustConfig: trustConfig)","wallet.bleTransferMode = .client"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"BLE Transport Factory","anchor":"BLE-Transport-Factory","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/EudiWallet\/bleTransportFactory","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" property lets you plug in a custom BLE transport implementation for proximity presentation. This enables alternative BLE communication channels (e.g., L2CAP or a custom BLE client mdoc transport) without modifying the library."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A transport factory conforms to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BleTransportFactory"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol and provides "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"createServer()"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"createClient()"},{"type":"text","text":" methods that each return an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MdocBleTransport"},{"type":"text","text":" instance. When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" (the default), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DefaultBleTransportFactory"},{"type":"text","text":" is used, which creates the standard GATT server\/central transports."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Provide a custom factory at initialization","let config = EudiWalletConfiguration(","    serviceName: \"my_wallet_app\",","    bleTransferMode: .server,","    bleTransportFactory: MyCustomTransportFactory()",")","let trustConfig = TrustConfiguration(trustSource: .etsi(.eudiRef), fallbackTrustSource: nil)","let wallet = try! EudiWallet(eudiWalletConfig: config, trustConfig: trustConfig)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"OpenID4VCI Configuration","anchor":"OpenID4VCI-Configuration","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet now supports multiple OpenID4VCI issuer configurations for enhanced flexibility. You can configure the wallet with a dictionary of issuer configurations:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Configure multiple OpenID4VCI issuers with DPoP support","let issuerConfigurations: [String: OpenId4VciConfiguration] = [","    \"eudi_pid_issuer\": OpenId4VciConfiguration(","        credentialIssuerURL: \"https:\/\/pid.issuer.example.com\",","        keyAttestationsConfig: KeyAttestationConfiguration(walletAttestationsProvider: myWalletAttestationsProvider),","        requireDpop: true,","        issuerMetadataPolicy: .requireSigned(issuerTrust: issuerTrustAnchor),","        dpopKeyOptions: KeyOptions(","            secureAreaName: \"SecureEnclave\", curve: .P256, accessControl: .requireUserPresence","        )","    ),","    \"mdl_issuer\": OpenId4VciConfiguration(","        credentialIssuerURL: \"https:\/\/mdl.issuer.example.com\",","        keyAttestationsConfig: KeyAttestationConfiguration(walletAttestationsProvider: myWalletAttestationsProvider),","        requireDpop: false,","        issuerMetadataPolicy: .ignoreSigned","    )","]","","\/\/ Register additional issuers after initialization","try wallet.registerOpenId4VciServices(issuerConfigurations)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"code":"issuerMetadataPolicy","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to control signed metadata handling per issuer:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".requireSigned","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for issuers that require signed metadata validation","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ignoreSigned"},{"type":"text","text":" for environments that still use unsigned metadata"}]}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/ManageDocuments","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/SecureAreas","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/PresentationService","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/RegistrationCertificate","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/TrustMark","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/WalletUI"],"anchor":"Essentials","generated":true,"title":"Essentials"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/GetStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/eudiwalletkit\/getstarted"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"Get started","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"EudiWalletKit"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"references":{"doc://EudiWalletKit/documentation/EudiWalletKit/EudiWallet/bleTransferMode":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Ble transfer mode"}],"url":"\/documentation\/eudiwalletkit\/eudiwallet\/bletransfermode","type":"topic","title":"bleTransferMode","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bleTransferMode","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BleTransferMode","preciseIdentifier":"s:21MdocDataTransfer1801315BleTransferModeO","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/EudiWallet\/bleTransferMode"},"doc://EudiWalletKit/documentation/EudiWalletKit":{"title":"EudiWalletKit","abstract":[{"text":"EUDI Wallet Kit library for iOS","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit","url":"\/documentation\/eudiwalletkit","role":"collection","type":"topic"},"doc://EudiWalletKit/documentation/EudiWalletKit/RegistrationCertificate":{"abstract":[{"text":"Validate the Wallet-Relying Party Registration Certificate (WRPRC) that a relying party presents with a data-sharing request, or that a credential issuer publishes with its metadata.","type":"text"}],"title":"Registration Certificate","url":"\/documentation\/eudiwalletkit\/registrationcertificate","role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/RegistrationCertificate","kind":"article","type":"to